      "description": "  ●●●Compatible with Levoit Core Mini Air Purifier ●●●\n\n●About this item \n✅【Official Replacement Filter】Using genuine Levoit HEPA Replacement Filters guarantees peak performance for the Core Mini Air Purifier and ensures what you're buying is worthy of your investment. \n✅【3-Stage Filter System】The Pre-Filter, Personal HEPA Filter, and Activated Carbon Filter work together to reduce airborne particles and unwanted odors in your living space for improved air quality. \n✅【TRUE HEPA Filtration】 TRUE HEPA Filter and High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter remove at least 99.97% of airborne particles 0.3 microns in diameter.  Effective for dusts, pollen, pet dander, smoke, and odour.\n✅【Trap Household Odors】The Activated Carbon Filter physically adsorbs smoke, cooking smells, pet odors, and toxic fumes, making it ideal for pet owners, smokers, and people who live in cities. \n✅【Buy with Confidence】Filters are sealed to protect their service life. Remove the plastic packaging before running the air purifier. If you encounter any issues with your replacement filter, please contact our helpful Customer Support Team. \n\n● What's in the Box? \n- 1 x Core Mini 3-Stage Original Filter",
